#: nvda-addon/addon/globalPlugins/NeovimAccessLink/nvda_ui.py:1008
msgid "The basic configuration applies to every selected target. Copying transfers the complete local Windows configuration only to selected Linux connections. Existing target configuration is backed up first. Windows-specific paths and directly executed scripts may need adjustment on Linux. With lazy.nvim, the installed Access Link copy must be listed explicitly as a local plugin. Review the local configuration for secrets before copying it."
